			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 790480101,
					"content": "這裡好像有一些紙片，是誰的筆記嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790480102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "閱讀"
				},
				{
					"id": 790480102,
					"content": "看這裡面的用詞…好像是一位畫家留下來的日記？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790480103,
						790480104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "閱讀"
				},
				{
					"id": 790480103,
					"content": "好有自信…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790480105
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 790480105,
					"content": "也不是不能理解啦，如果沒有一股氣勢的話，無論做什麼事，本領都不會飛快進步的吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790480106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "閱讀"
				},
				{
					"id": 790480106,
					"content": "不過，這一部分日記有點少，不知道他後來怎麼樣了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790480107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "閱讀"
				},
				{
